# STT models: "pick all that works"

Goal: try every local speech-to-text candidate that runs on this Mac (M3 Pro, macOS 14.4) and
make each one that works selectable in Flowstate, with tests and an install script.

Baseline (whisper.cpp large-v3-turbo, beam 5): real WER 5.39% p50 0.72 s; TTS WER 3.98% p50 0.82 s.
"Works" = runs locally through a loopback server, real-speech WER within 1 point of the baseline,
and a clear gain (lower WER or lower latency).

## Benchmark (73 real LibriSpeech clips + 80 TTS clips with 16 tech terms)
- [x] Parakeet TDT 0.6B v2 q8_0: real 2.87% p50 0.09 s; TTS 11.46% (Samantha voice 36%); e2e terms 51/80 -> WORKS
